%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Display: markdown
Type: Output
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Output panel. __Evaluate this cell very last__

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Type: Input
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
{Graphics[{(*VB[*)(RGBColor[0.922526, 0.385626, 0.209179])(*,*)(*"1:eJxTTMoPSmNkYGAoZgESHvk5KRCeGJAIcndyzs/JLwouTyxJzghJzS3ISSxJTWMGyXMgyRdd2frNLrT1rX3RHf35ayTW3bAv0nBnXJRw7JQ9AKbfHmU="*)(*]VB*),
  Table[With[{index = i + 20 (j-1)},
    Disk[{i,j}, Offload[0.2 + 0.1 exposed[[index]] ] ]
  ], {i, 20}, {j, 20}],
  
  AnimationFrameListener[exposed // Offload, "Event"->"isingRun"] 
}], ListLinePlotly[mag // Offload] } // Row 

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Props:
  Hidden: true
Type: Input
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
.md
